{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ahoy, ye port rats! It be time to leave the land for the lily-livered and set sail into the cursed waters of Curse of Pirates \u2014 a swashbuckling action roguelike where honor, luck, and good ol' rum decide yer fate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/8dd044b4beb3c658747f5acd72eeeee0.poster.avif?t=1774002892\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/8dd044b4beb3c658747f5acd72eeeee0.webm?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/8dd044b4beb3c658747f5acd72eeeee0.mp4?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a captain whose fame echoes across all seven seas! Explore the far corners of the ocean, hunt for ancient treasure maps, and slice through hordes of enemies: sea monsters, ruthless corsair scoundrels, undead fiends, nightmarish beasts, and even cursed gods of the deep! And watch out for those damned parrots \u2014 they're a real nuisance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t dawdle, ye scallywags! Add the game to your Wishlist, subscribe for updates on Steam, and don\u2019t miss yer chance to join the playtests and free demos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All hands on deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/8eb37c2c96c3e689fbdb1238870c20d9.poster.avif?t=1774002892\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/8eb37c2c96c3e689fbdb1238870c20d9.webm?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/8eb37c2c96c3e689fbdb1238870c20d9.mp4?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the captain of yer destiny!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You be an ambitious captain of a rickety ship with grand dreams. Want to rule the pirate world and become the fiercest and richest Pirate King? Then prepare to traverse fire, water, and a storm of cannon fire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/56ec5e3462901c6dac9e41b866ea4a62.poster.avif?t=1774002892\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/56ec5e3462901c6dac9e41b866ea4a62.webm?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/56ec5e3462901c6dac9e41b866ea4a62.mp4?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of Pirates be:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2693 Endless waves of foes! Enemies will keep comin\u2019 at ye, stronger and craftier with each attack. Use yer wits to navigate between islands and sea monsters!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2693 Hundreds of unique builds! Mix and match skills to change your combat style, boost yer weaponry, and even turn the tide of battle!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2693 Epic maritime campaigns! Several acts filled with brutal bosses will take ye through whirlpools, ship graveyards, and the lairs of monsters thirsting for yer blood!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2693 The true pirate life! Enough languishing in port with a barrel of rum\u2014hoist the sails and set forth for new adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire a crew or ye might regret it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/c47a8fb9e56caf3c4026ca12ec1b65f9.poster.avif?t=1774002892\" width=780 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/c47a8fb9e56caf3c4026ca12ec1b65f9.webm?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/c47a8fb9e56caf3c4026ca12ec1b65f9.mp4?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ye can\u2019t survive alone on the sea! A gallery of unique characters awaits ye, each with their own stories, quirks, and deadly skills:\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620 Ghostly captains who summon the dead!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620 Dark cultists dabbling with ancient powers!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620 Zar\u2019Kul, a spawn of the abyss, bringing chaos and destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will be yer loyal mate? A fiery-haired beauty with a big heart? A ghost captain with unfinished business? Or perhaps something much darker\u2026 Choose wisely and be ready for the consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/74f3ec0e8e87429be48422bbe36ba3bf.poster.avif?t=1774002892\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/74f3ec0e8e87429be48422bbe36ba3bf.webm?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/74f3ec0e8e87429be48422bbe36ba3bf.mp4?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where be the map? We need a map!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the grand tradition of pirate tales, ye shall embark on dangerous adventures in search of ancient treasures, not all of which ye truly want to find. A map and the ability to alter the terrain will aid ye, allowing for the addition or removal of elements on the battlefield. True pirates don\u2019t sail blindly! Seek out ancient treasure maps, but beware\u2014not all that glitters is worth the haul. Change the land to shift the course of battle!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/0c96283ecf2b3a63b8ac7558e91567d2.poster.avif?t=1774002892\" width=780 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/0c96283ecf2b3a63b8ac7558e91567d2.webm?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/0c96283ecf2b3a63b8ac7558e91567d2.mp4?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Sing pirate shanties with yer crew, keeping spirits high before the storm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meeting with other ambitious captains approaches, many of whom may seem familiar. But who among ye will become a legend, and who will sink to the depths, becoming mere shark bait?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/65bbcd31e237b463bcf0f97f062b13f3.poster.avif?t=1774002892\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/65bbcd31e237b463bcf0f97f062b13f3.webm?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/65bbcd31e237b463bcf0f97f062b13f3.mp4?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fifteen men on the dead man's chest\u2014</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...Yo-ho-ho, and a bottle of rum!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Drink and the devil had done for the rest\u2014</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...Yo-ho-ho, and a bottle of rum!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All hands on deck!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast off the lines, hoist the sails! Full speed ahead to glory and riches! \u2620\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484940?t=1774002892","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484940?t=1774002892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/a6736599456dee4a76074f0c2ffeea7fb8327a2d/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774002892","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/a6736599456dee4a76074f0c2ffeea7fb8327a2d/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774002892","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4057580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ahoy, ye port rats! It be time to leave the land for the lily-livered and set sail into the cursed waters of Curse of Pirates \u2014 a swashbuckling action roguelike where honor, luck, and good ol' rum decide yer fate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn