 ambitious captain of a rickety ship with grand dreams. Want to rule the pirate world and become the fiercest and richest Pirate King? Then prepare to traverse fire, water, and a storm of cannon fire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/56ec5e3462901c6dac9e41b866ea4a62.poster.avif?t=1774002892\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/56ec5e3462901c6dac9e41b866ea4a62.webm?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/56ec5e3462901c6dac9e41b866ea4a62.mp4?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of Pirates be:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2693 Endless waves of foes! Enemies will keep comin\u2019 at ye, stronger and craftier with each attack. Use yer wits to navigate between islands and sea monsters!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2693 Hundreds of unique builds! Mix and match skills to change your combat style, boost yer weaponry, and even turn the tide of battle!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2693 Epic maritime campaigns! Several acts filled with brutal bosses will take ye through whirlpools, ship graveyards, and the lairs of monsters thirsting for yer blood!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2693 The true pirate life! Enough languishing in port with a barrel of rum\u2014hoist the sails and set forth for new adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire a crew or ye might regret it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/c47a8fb9e56caf3c4026ca12ec1b65f9.poster.avif?t=1