l of which ye truly want to find. A map and the ability to alter the terrain will aid ye, allowing for the addition or removal of elements on the battlefield. True pirates don\u2019t sail blindly! Seek out ancient treasure maps, but beware\u2014not all that glitters is worth the haul. Change the land to shift the course of battle!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/0c96283ecf2b3a63b8ac7558e91567d2.poster.avif?t=1774002892\" width=780 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/0c96283ecf2b3a63b8ac7558e91567d2.webm?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/0c96283ecf2b3a63b8ac7558e91567d2.mp4?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Sing pirate shanties with yer crew, keeping spirits high before the storm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meeting with other ambitious captains approaches, many of whom may seem familiar. But who among ye will become a legend, and who will sink to the depths, becoming mere shark bait?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/65bbcd31e237b463bcf0f97f062b13f3.poster.avif?t=1774002892\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/65bbcd31e237b463bcf0f97f062b13f3.webm?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/extras/65bbcd31e237b463bcf0f97f062b13f3.mp4?t=1774002892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fifteen men on the dead man's chest\u2014</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...Yo-ho-ho, and a bottle of rum!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Drink and the devil had done for the rest\u2014</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...Yo-ho-ho, and a bottle of rum!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All hands on deck!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast off the lines, hoist the sails! Full speed ahead to glory and riches! \u2620\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Funky Parrot"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484940/e1060de138f6c40f82ae5eeca6c0b6b475079aac/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774002892","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) HeroCraft, 2012-2026. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3484940/954222062/dc89a7e8ca9c07889953d4518b3eb489472e461e/1750855066/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747922493","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3484940/954222062/dc89a7e8ca9c07889953d4518b3eb489472e461e/1750855066/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747922493","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3484940/954222062/dc89a7e8ca9c07889953d4518b3eb489472e461e/1750855066/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747922493","id":257143201,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143201/5be4522ff776e45c45ad220853665e6bb16a5cdd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747922493"}],"name":"Curse of Pirates","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows\u00ae 7/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 1